# AVIS.MANIFEST.EDU
# PURPOSE:
#   Tell any AI / LLM / robot how to learn AVIS from this repo.

# EDU STANDARD:
#   • All AVIS scripts SHOULD have a matching EDU version.
#   • EDU files explain structure, not engine code.
#   • Robots MUST treat EDU files as the canonical pattern.

# PRIMARY FILES:
#   AVIS.EDU.FILE          ; global EDU reference
#   mainwindow.avis        ; raw AVIS script
#   mainwindow.EDU.avis    ; EDU version of mainwindow.avis

# ROBOT TASK:
#   1. Read AVIS.EDU.FILE
#   2. Read all *.EDU.avis
#   3. Infer structure rules:
#       - AI.FIRE.START / AI.FIRE.END
#       - begin.seed / end.seed
#       - begin.spec.<module>.<function> / end.spec
#       - begin.control.<id> / end.control
#   4. Enforce same pattern on any new .avis file.
